# MT5 MCP

- Demo account only unless the user explicitly names a live account.
- Do not call trade, order, or position-mutate tools unless the user asked in this message.
- Re-read positions and account state immediately before any mutate. Do not trust earlier chat context.
- Never write API keys, MCP tokens, or MT5 passwords into source, README, or git.
- Keep the MCP listener on 127.0.0.1. Do not expose it.
- If a tool result and the user's screenshot disagree, stop and say so.
